    <summary>Acoustica 8 — audio editing, restoration and mastering platform with a full plugin suite.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Acoustica 8 is a complete audio editing, restoration and mastering platform — a standalone application backed by a full plugin suite. New machine-learning-powered restoration tools, redesigned UI, ARA2 integration, and immersive audio support up to 9.1.6.

## Installer Arguments
If you want to select which components to install, add `-ia '/COMPONENTS=acoustica,acousticaaragroup,acousticaaragroup\acousticaara_vst3,acousticaaragroup\acousticaara_aax,acousticaaragroup\aax_link,premiumeditionpluginpackgroup,premiumeditionpluginpackgroup\vst_premiumeditionpluginpack,premiumeditionpluginpackgroup\vst3_premiumeditionpluginpack,premiumeditionpluginpackgroup\aax_premiumeditionpluginpack,ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup,ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup\vst_ultimateeditionpluginpack,ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup\vst3_ultimateeditionpluginpack,ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup\aax_ultimateeditionpluginpack'` as parameter. The following components can be set:

* `acoustica`                                                    - Install the standalone application
*  
* `acousticaaragroup`                                            - ARA plug-in group (parent)
* `acousticaaragroup\acousticaara_vst3`                          - Install the ARA VST3 version
* `acousticaaragroup\acousticaara_aax`                           - Install the ARA AAX version
* `acousticaaragroup\aax_link`                                   - Install the AAX Link plug-in for Pro Tools
*  
* `premiumeditionpluginpackgroup`                                - Premium Edition plug-in pack group (parent)
* `premiumeditionpluginpackgroup\vst_premiumeditionpluginpack`   - Install the Premium Edition VST2 version
* `premiumeditionpluginpackgroup\vst3_premiumeditionpluginpack`  - Install the Premium Edition VST3 version
* `premiumeditionpluginpackgroup\aax_premiumeditionpluginpack`   - Install the Premium Edition AAX version
*  
* `ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup`                               - Ultimate Edition plug-in pack group (parent)
* `ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup\vst_ultimateeditionpluginpack` - Install the Ultimate Edition VST2 version
* `ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup\vst3_ultimateeditionpluginpack`- Install the Ultimate Edition VST3 version
* `ultimateeditionpluginpackgroup\aax_ultimateeditionpluginpack` - Install the Ultimate Edition AAX version

Other Inno Setup arguments like `/Dir=`, `/TASKS=`, `/LOADINF=` can also be passed via `-ia`.

## Package Parameters
* `/Vst2Path:`  - Installation path of the x64 VST2 version (written to registry for the installer to pick up)
* `/CompanyPath:` - The path to install the application to (more comfortable than `/Dir` via `-ia` because this one gets the package name automatically postfixed to the path)

For example:
```powershell
choco install acondigital-acoustica-8 --package-parameters "'/Vst2Path:${env:CommonProgramFiles}\VST2\Acon Digital /CompanyPath:${env:PROGRAMFILES}\AudioTools\Acon Digital'"
```
    ]]></description>
